    <h2>How these walkthroughs are made<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Every level here is written from a recorded playthrough and then checked against a second, independent all-levels guide: the goal banner has to match word for word before the two versions are compared move by move. Each page says how far that check got, and when only one source covers a level it says that too. Brain Puzzle 3 does not hand every player the same scene at the same number, so where a level number maps to two scenes we publish both. No invented answers, no hint-item spam.</p>

    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
   
    <details><summary>What is Brain Puzzle 3: Crazy Mind?</summary><p>Brain Puzzle 3: Crazy Mind is a free-to-play brain teaser game by Joygame with story-driven trick levels: each level is a short scene where you tap, drag or expose the right thing to solve a mini puzzle. It is the third game in the Brain Puzzle series after Tricky Quest and Logic Twist.</p></details>
    <details><summary>How many levels does Brain Puzzle 3 have?</summary><p>Brain Puzzle 3 launched with well over a hundred story levels and keeps adding more through updates. This guide covers every level from 1 to 137, and where one level number maps to two different scenes it covers both.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is Brain Puzzle 3 free?</summary><p>Yes, Brain Puzzle 3 is free to download and play on iOS and Android. It is ad-supported: you can watch ads for hints if you get stuck, though every walkthrough on this page lets you clear levels without spending a hint.</p></details>

